{"articleNo":"2140","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=2140&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"제2회 역사콘서트(고구려를 찾아서) 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2011.11.22","hit":"9364","attachments":[],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<!--StartFragment-->&nbsp;\n<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;HY헤드라인M&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 15pt\">제2회 역사콘서트 </span></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;HY엽서M&quot;; COLOR: #008000; FONT-SIZE: 21pt\">“고구려를 찾아서</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;HY엽서M&quot;; COLOR: #008000; FONT-SIZE: 21pt\">”</span></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 100%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 100%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;HY헤드라인M&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><br></span></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0.7pt\"><font size=\"3\">고구려, 발해가 중국의 지방정권이라고? 신라와 백제가 중국의 속국이라고?</font></span></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><font size=\"3\">한-중 두 나라의 관계와 역사에서 궁금한 것들을 풀어 드립니다.</font></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0.9pt\"><font size=\"3\">반크와 글로벌 역사외교관 등 청년들의 역사지킴이 체험을 나눕시다.</font></span></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0.9pt\"><br><font size=\"3\"></font></span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; MARGIN-LEFT: 20pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">□ 일&nbsp; 시 : 2011년 12월 5일(월요일) 19:00~21:00</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; MARGIN-LEFT: 20pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">□ 장&nbsp; 소 : 서울역사박물관</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; MARGIN-LEFT: 20pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">□ 주&nbsp; 최 : 동북아역사재단(문화일보 후원)</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; MARGIN-LEFT: 20pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">□ 참가대상 : 청소년 및 대학생</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; MARGIN-LEFT: 20pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;o 한국사, 동아시아 역사에 관심이 많은 학생</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; TEXT-INDENT: -35pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 55pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;o </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; LETTER-SPACING: 0.1pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">외국 친구들에게 대한민국과 우리역사를 세계에 당당히 알리고 싶은 학생</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; MARGIN-LEFT: 20pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">□ 참가인원 : 200명</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; MARGIN-LEFT: 20pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">□ 참가자 모집 </span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; MARGIN-LEFT: 20pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;o 모집기간 : 2011.11.21(월)~11.27(일)</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; MARGIN-LEFT: 20pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;o </span><a href=\"http://www.nahf.or.kr/hcon.html\" target=\"_self\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">신청서 작성</span></a><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"> : http://www.nahf.or.kr/hcon.html</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; TEXT-INDENT: -40pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 40pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;※ </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; LETTER-SPACING: 0.1pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">참가자 모두에게 고구려를 이해하고, 대한민국을 세계에 알릴 수 있는 한국홍보자료를 드립니다.</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"> </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; LETTER-SPACING: 0.3pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">또한 독도와 대한민국 역사를 세계에 올바로 알리는 역사콘서트 홍보대사로 참여할 수 있습니다.</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; MARGIN-LEFT: 20pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">□ 프로그램 </span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; MARGIN-LEFT: 20pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;o 사회 : 박기태 반크 단장</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; TEXT-INDENT: -111.2pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 131.2pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;o 이야기손님 : </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; LETTER-SPACING: 0.7pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">반크회원, 글로벌 역사외교관, 신형식(서울시사 편찬위원장), 임기환</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; LETTER-SPACING: 0.2pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">(서울교대 교수), 고광의(동북아역사재단 연구위원)</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 100%; MARGIN-LEFT: 20pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><font size=\"3\">&nbsp; o 세부내용</font></p>\n<table style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: medium none; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; BORDER-COLLAPSE: collapse; BORDER-TOP: medium none; BORDER-RIGHT: medium none\" border=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\n    <tbody>\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; PADDING-LEFT: 5.1pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 5.1pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt\" height=\"26\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"88\">\n            <p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span>시 간</span></p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; PADDING-LEFT: 5.1pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 5.1pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt\" height=\"26\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"348\">\n            <p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span>내&nbsp; 용</span></p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; PADDING-LEFT: 5.1pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 5.1pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt\" height=\"26\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"124\">\n            <p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span>담당</span></p>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; PADDING-LEFT: 5.1pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 5.1pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt\" height=\"25\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"88\">\n            <p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0.9pt\">18:00~19:00</span></p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; PADDING-LEFT: 5.1pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 5.1pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt\" height=\"25\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"348\">\n            <p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span>○ 등록</span></p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; PADDING-LEFT: 5.1pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 5.1pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt\" height=\"25\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"124\">\n            <p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\" class=\"HStyle0\">&nbsp;</p>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: medium none; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; PADDING-LEFT: 5.1pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 5.1pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt\" height=\"232\" valign=\"middle\" rowspan=\"5\" width=\"88\">\n            <p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0.9pt\">19:00~20:50</span></p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; PADDING-LEFT: 5.1pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 5.1pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt\" height=\"18\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"348\">\n            <p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span>○</span> <span>공연</span>(라파엘 시각장애인 합창단)</p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; PADDING-LEFT: 5.1pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 5.1pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt\" height=\"18\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"124\">\n            <p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\" class=\"HStyle0\">&nbsp;</p>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; PADDING-LEFT: 5.1pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 5.1pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt\" height=\"76\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"348\">\n            <p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span>○ </span><span>영상상영</span></p>\n            <p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\" class=\"HStyle0\">&nbsp;&nbsp;- 아프리카에 역사한류 씨앗을 뿌리다!</p>\n            <p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\" class=\"HStyle0\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;(반크 짐바브웨 활동영상)</p>\n            <p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\" class=\"HStyle0\">&nbsp;&nbsp;- 한국사를 왜곡 서술한 해외 사례 모음</p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; PADDING-LEFT: 5.1pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 5.1pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt\" height=\"76\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"124\">\n            <p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\" class=\"HStyle0\">반크</p>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; PADDING-LEFT: 5.1pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 5.1pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt\" height=\"25\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"348\">\n            <p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0.3pt\">○ 전문가 대담</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0.3pt\">(“고구려, 백재, 신라, 발해와 중국”)</span></p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; PADDING-LEFT: 5.1pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 5.1pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt\" height=\"25\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"124\">\n            <p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\" class=\"HStyle0\">신형식 위원장</p>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; PADDING-LEFT: 5.1pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 5.1pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt\" height=\"76\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"348\">\n            <p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0.3pt\">○ </span><span>역사학자와 청년 대화</span>, “아는 것이 힘이다“</p>\n            <p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; TEXT-INDENT: 20.5pt\" class=\"HStyle0\">- 역사지킴이 활동 체험 나누기</p>\n            <p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; TEXT-INDENT: 20.5pt\" class=\"HStyle0\">- 조공책봉 관계 제대로 알기</p>\n            <p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; TEXT-INDENT: 20.5pt\" class=\"HStyle0\">- 동북공정 등 역사왜곡 대응 논리</p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; PADDING-LEFT: 5.1pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 5.1pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt\" height=\"76\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"124\">\n            <p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\" class=\"HStyle0\">반크 회원 3~4명</p>\n            <p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\" class=\"HStyle0\">신영식 위원장</p>\n            <p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\" class=\"HStyle0\">임기환 교수</p>\n            <p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\" class=\"HStyle0\">고광의 박사</p>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; PADDING-LEFT: 5.1pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 5.1pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt\" height=\"38\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"348\">\n            <p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0.3pt\">○ </span><span>질문있습니다</span></p>\n            <p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\" class=\"HStyle0\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 객석과 대화, 트위터 질문 받기</p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; PADDING-LEFT: 5.1pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 5.1pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt\" height=\"38\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"124\">\n            <p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\" class=\"HStyle0\">&nbsp;</p>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; PADDING-LEFT: 5.1pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 5.1pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt\" height=\"26\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"88\">\n            <p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0.9pt\">20:50~21:00</span></p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; PADDING-LEFT: 5.1pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 5.1pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt\" height=\"26\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"348\">\n            <p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0.3pt\">○ </span><span>마무리 </span>: 청년 역사 콘서트 비전 선포식</p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; PADDING-LEFT: 5.1pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 5.1pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt\" height=\"26\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"124\">\n            <p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\" class=\"HStyle0\">&nbsp;</p>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n    </tbody>\n</table>\n<span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 100%; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
